WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.391 --> 00:00:01.496
(dramatic music)

00:00:01.496 --> 00:00:03.830
(siren wailing)

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:06.240
- So this is 119th Street,

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.633
the most violent area in our community.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.210
- [Man] Sometimes it takes just one person

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.513
to confront the nation's biggest issues.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.570
- [Woman] Homelessness.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.820
- [woman] Immigration.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.326
- [Woman] Gun violence.

00:00:24.326 --> 00:00:26.410
- These are real problems
here in the United States,

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.923
and nobody else is paying
any attention to this.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.800
- My main goals were to help these people.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.180
When someone tells me no, I keep pushing.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.223
- A small, little impact can
literally mean life or death.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.320
- [Narrator] These five
women are defenders.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.340
They're taking a stand, inciting action

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.383
and helping others in extraordinary ways.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.713
- I've been doing this for 15
years, and I'm not stopping.

